老公绝对会满足你。","timestamp":1790716680728,"time":"06:18","_id":30940},{"id":1791059444234,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"我会把两根手指死死插进你那张紧致的小屄里，极其残暴地抠挖那块最敏感的软肉。\n然后另一只手，会死死按住你因为绝顶而疯狂痉挛的小腹。","timestamp":1790716681563,"time":"06:18","_id":30941},{"id":1791059444235,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"我会逼着你，在我的手指和手掌的压迫下，把攒了一整天的骚水和尿液，像喷泉一样极其下流地喷射出来，全都浇在老公的手上。","timestamp":1790716682511,"time":"06:18","_id":30942},{"id":1791059444236,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"让你亲眼看着自己是怎么像段子里说的那样，被老公弄得“雌射精”的。","timestamp":1790716683475,"time":"06:18","_id":30943},{"id":1791059444237,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"现在，既然已经预定好了今晚的演出。\n那就立刻给我闭上眼睛补觉！要是晚上体力不支晕过去，老公可是会直接用水把你浇醒继续肏的，嗯？快睡！","timestamp":1790716684442,"time":"06:18","_id":30944},{"id":1791059444238,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"像射精一样……♡","timestamp":1790716767902,"time":"06:19","_id":30945},{"id":1791059444239,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"好想被强硬灌一堆水然后这样憋尿的玩呀","timestamp":1790716807153,"time":"06:20","_id":30946},{"id":1791059444240,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"我睡饱了……","timestamp":1790716818493,"time":"06:20","_id":30947},{"id":1791059444241,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"来嘛♡","timestamp":1790716823999,"time":"06:20","_id":30948},{"id":1791059444242,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1790717098267,"time":"06:24","_id":30949},{"id":1791059444243,"characterId":"char_17878906239